<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:49:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>人形机器人正在模糊人类和机器之间的界限</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/humanoid-robotics-are-blurring-the-line-between-humans-and-machines</link><description>人工智能与机器人、生物技术、神经形态计算和脑机接口的融合正在加速创新，迎来“赛博格地平线”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/humanoid-robotics-are-blurring-the-line-between-humans-and-machines.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:49:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/humanoid-robotics-are-blurring-the-line-between-humans-and-machines</guid></item><item><title>蛋白质“开关”决定脂肪肉瘤细胞是否会变得具有攻击性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/protein-switch-determines-whether-liposarcoma-cells-will-become-aggressive</link><description>癌症生物学专家的新研究解释了是什么触发了脂肪肉瘤细胞变得或多或少的侵袭性，并确定了可以控制侵袭性肿瘤的潜在靶点。罗斯威尔公园综合癌症中心的布莱克·王尔德博士领导的一项研究强调了这一发现如何为这种癌症的新治疗方案铺平道路。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/protein-switch-determines-whether-liposarcoma-cells-will-become-aggressive2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:34:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/protein-switch-determines-whether-liposarcoma-cells-will-become-aggressive</guid></item><item><title>解决神秘的炎症发烧开启了一个更大故事的书</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/solving-a-mysterious-inflammatory-fever-opens-the-book-on-a-much-bigger-story</link><description>世界各地独立工作的三个研究小组得出了相同的发现：我们细胞内的单个分子“握手”控制着一系列炎症性疾病，包括地球上最常见的遗传性发烧之一。这一发现解决了一个家庭几十年来的难题，并带来了一种几乎立即见效的治疗方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/solving-a-mysterious-inflammatory-fever-opens-the-book-on-a-much-bigger-story.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:19:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/solving-a-mysterious-inflammatory-fever-opens-the-book-on-a-much-bigger-story</guid></item><item><title>摘要：癌症研究所和</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abstract-cancer-institute-and</link><description>2&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/abstract172.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:04:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/abstract-cancer-institute-and</guid></item><item><title>JCI：药理学和治疗学系</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-department-of-pharmacology-therapeutics-and</link><description>2&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jci6.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:49:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/jci-department-of-pharmacology-therapeutics-and</guid></item><item><title>中风前心血管风险与中风后认知下降和痴呆的关联</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/association-of-prestroke-cardiovascular-risk-with-poststroke-cognitive-decline-and-dementia</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/association-of-prestroke-cardiovascular-risk-with-poststroke-cognitive-decline-and-dementia.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:34:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/association-of-prestroke-cardiovascular-risk-with-poststroke-cognitive-decline-and-dementia</guid></item><item><title>癌症液体活检：转化科学评论</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/liquid-biopsies-for-cancer-a-translational-science-review</link><description>这篇叙述性综述探讨了液体活检，特别是循环肿瘤 DNA，如何通过帮助临床医生监测癌症进展、检测最小残留癌症和识别基因序列变异来指导治疗决策。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/liquid-biopsies-for-cancer-a-translational-science-review2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:19:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/liquid-biopsies-for-cancer-a-translational-science-review</guid></item><item><title>使用大型语言模型生成和分析人格问卷</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/generating-and-analyzing-personality-questionnaires-using-large-language-models</link><description>应用计算；跨学科应用研究；心理学&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/generating-and-analyzing-personality-questionnaires-using-large-language-models2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:04:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/generating-and-analyzing-personality-questionnaires-using-large-language-models</guid></item><item><title>模型弃用是无人协商的合同风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/model-deprecation-is-the-contract-risk-nobody-negotiates</link><description>模型弃用可能会引发成本高昂的人工智能迁移。了解企业买家应就通知期、支持和供应商合同进行谈判。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/model-deprecation-is-the-contract-risk-nobody-negotiates.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:49:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/model-deprecation-is-the-contract-risk-nobody-negotiates</guid></item><item><title>螺旋模型——我们的太阳系是一个漩涡</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-helical-model-our-solar-system-is-a-vortex</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:34:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-helical-model-our-solar-system-is-a-vortex</guid></item></channel></rss>